{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e76751010708313d72288e79004a83967ed219da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/f/e4ffb8d1d2e875fc449d02088aee08a73f9b2079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{N\\sqrt[3]{N\\sqrt[3]{N}}} =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"121\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffe69a6e6b1e4bc6ec7d7a186814ee4f364b997.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } N^{\\frac 1{27}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } N^{\\frac 1{9}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } N^{\\frac 1{3}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } N^{\\frac {13}{27}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"435\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The key identities are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/e/deee5ab646d686f6ab1daf24c8f60861fb692094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{x^n} = x^{\\frac{n}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/5/1f5914a4abda3ce7a17c196ae2f0e29b67cc9380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\cdot x^{\\frac{a}{b}} = x^{1 + \\frac{a}{b}}$\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/3928705993da8c6bc5863c4d4400db2099dd2d55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{N\\sqrt[3]{N\\sqrt[3]{N}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"102\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c75c9eabc99a5fe7137418757e69ccb4635eae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{N\\sqrt[3]{N\\cdot N^{\\frac{1}{3}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac92f5062a2cb1c13d0dc0c8d32f360ca2d7f00b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{N\\sqrt[3]{N^{\\frac{4}{3}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/3/353756add9e01230053920611b5834b6cb2eac59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{N\\cdot{N^{\\frac{4}{9}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/a/f9a757658a98539dc0500a311d195ec2ac76b68d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{{N^{\\frac{13}{9}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/5/ab572d5e1ce0f5506a34343264c570f0c5f2aba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N^{\\frac{13}{27}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"19\" />, thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/w